What is AI Freight Optimization?
AI freight optimization refers to the application of artificial‑intelligence techniques-especially supervised and unsupervised machine‑learning models-to transform raw transportation data into prescriptive actions. These actions include optimal lane selection, real‑time load‑matching, dynamic pricing adjustments, and proactive disruption mitigation. The technology stack typically combines cloud‑native compute, edge‑installed inference engines, and IoT sensor streams, allowing carriers to make split‑second decisions even in bandwidth‑constrained environments.
